    "shortCode": "Dd6ZHIeBtKe",
    "caption": "#Microsoft’s strategy for the new #Copilot comes down to model choice and company context.\n\nModel choice: You can switch between models from different providers (or let Auto mode choose one for the task).\n\nCompany context: A project update might be spread across 50 Word docs, 7 Teams channels, and dozens of emails. Work IQ helps Copilot find the relevant information, and it only uses what you’re allowed to see.\n\nThe goal is AI built for entire companies, with a model that fits the task and the company context needed to complete it.\n\nIf your company uses Copilot, let me know your actual experiences with the new app down below!",
