   {
    "id": "3977324575242969125",
    "type": "Video",
    "shortCode": "DcyS6DfyeAl",
    "caption": "Your #AI has three levels of memory (and each one solves a different problem).\n\n1. Built-in memory (in ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini) handles broad preferences like your role and writing style. It stays high-level because it can influence every chat.\n2. Projects keep detailed preferences inside one area of work, so the AI can create detailed memories without mixing in unrelated context. If you prefer three bullet points per slide, it can apply that across every presentation in the Project.\n3. ChatGPT Work, Claude Cowork, and Gemini Spark let you decide what gets written down while the AI handles the grunt work. There is a learning curve (but this level gives you the most control).\n\nComment “cowork toolkit” to receive my free Cowork Toolkit!",
