    "shortCode": "DYuOly1FBTY",
    "caption": "Flew to #googleio and took more notes in two days than I did in 9 years as an employee 🤓.\n\nJokes aside, what an absolutely incredible week.\n\nTop 3 personal highlights:\n\n1️⃣ Interviewed Josh Woodward (Head of Google Gemini)\n2️⃣ Met some of the most talented and friendly creators from all over the world\n3️⃣ Got to meet and chat with SO MANY of you in person!!!!\n\nLooking back on the past few years, one saying keeps coming to mind:\n\n🙏 What a privilege it is to be tired from the work I once begged the universe for.\n🙏 What a privilege to feel overwhelmed by the growth I once dreamed about.\n🙏 What a privilege to be challenged by a life I created on purpose.\n\nThanks @google and see you next year (hopefully)! 😁",
