    "shortCode": "DYPVCley5p9",
    "caption": "Your entire #ClaudeCowork setup starts with two plain text files.\n\nCLAUDE.md is the instruction manual Cowork reads at the start of every session. Mine has a routing map that automatically loads my travel workstation when I start planning a trip, my email workstation when I’m drafting replies.\n\nEvery working mode gets its own instructions without me having to repeat anything.\n\nMEMORY.md stores your active projects and key decisions between sessions. When I planned a trip to Taiwan, Cowork pulled up the specific visa application I needed because it remembered I had to fill one out last time.\n\nTwo files. That’s the whole foundation.\n\nFollow for more practical #AI tips.\n\n#Claude\n\nComment “Cowork Toolkit” below to receive my free CLAUDE.md and MEMORY.md templates.",
